"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。时间花在多认识几个人上，别反复琢磨同一个人。难在忍住不死磕。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["两场闪电约会研究里，参与者见面前先填了 100 多项与择偶有关的自陈量表（自己给自己打分的问卷）。研究者用随机森林模型（一种找规律的算法）来算。能算出「一个人整体上有多容易喜欢别人」，这些问卷能说明其中 4%–18% 的方差，方差就是人与人之间的差别，问卷只能说明其中一小部分。也能算出「一个人整体上有多受欢迎」，能说明 7%–27%。但「这两个具体的人之间来不来电」算不出来，会前的特质和偏好怎么组合都算不出来。同一批研究者更早还做过一项闪电约会实验。参与者会前自己报了理想型偏好，比如看重外貌还是看重经济前景。这个偏好预测不了他们在现场对具体某个人的兴趣"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Joel S, Eastwick PW, Finkel EJ (2017). Is romantic desire predictable? Machine learning applied to initial romantic attraction. Psychological Science, 28(10), 1478-1489. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0956797617714580","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1177/0956797617714580"]},"；Eastwick PW, Finkel EJ (2008). Sex differences in mate preferences revisited: do people know what they initially desire in a romantic partner? Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 94(2), 245-264. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0022-3514.94.2.245","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/0022-3514.94.2.245"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0956797617714580","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["两项研究只说明「见面之前算不出来」，没说「怎么努力都没用」。合不合得来只能见了面才知道，所以把时间花在多认识几个人上，每个都真正见一面，比全押在一个人身上划算。研究对象都是欧美大学生。中国的婚恋环境不一样，套到自己身上要打折"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/10-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"对方明确拒绝之后就停下，继续纠缠是治安违法，不是「诚意」"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/10-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["判断对方有没有兴趣，看行为不看「信号」：谁主动、谁安排、谁跟进"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["让 52 对陌生男女聊十来分钟，再互相判断对方有没有在调情。结果是「对方没在调情」判得比较准，「对方在调情」反而看不出来。换成 261 个…"]}]}]},{"ta